# Mockingbird entering as a copy of Baleful Strix has Strix's "When this creature enters, draw a card" (CR 707.9a, 614.12,
# ruling: any "enters" abilities of the copied creature trigger), because it entered as that creature. Strix has mana value 2,
# equal to the two mana spent with X = 1. Bot1 holds 5 cards while it is on the stack, then 6 after the draw: the copy is an artifact
# creature Bird, with flying and deathtouch, and is not the Bard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mockingbird
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Baleful Strix
Island x13

